More of a useful note vs a full review (obviously haven't played much);
TURN OFF UBERSAMPLING! I tried playing this game on ultra and the frame rate went down the drain until I found out about this (it's in options, under advanced). Turned it off and boom, everything runs fine ^_^

One thing that has irked me though; I can't find a way to change the audio language even though the page says 5 languages have full audio -_-;
Anyone who knows how to do this... please let me know!

